# Implementation Plan: AI English Speaking Coach Mobile App

Build a production-quality, local-first **AI English Speaking Coach** mobile application with React Native (Expo) and a Python (FastAPI + Gemini) backend, styled following the **Editorial Monolith** design system (`DESIGN.md`).

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Local-First Database**: The mobile app strictly uses `expo-sqlite` locally with no cloud database (no Supabase/Firebase).
> - **Gemini API Key Security**: The Gemini API key will only be stored in `backend/.env` and will never be exposed to the mobile app.
> - **Design Aesthetic**: Adheres strictly to the monochrome, high-contrast, Swiss typographic style outlined in `prototype/DESIGN.md` (Hanken Grotesk typography, zinc/charcoal palette, tactile physical feel, minimal borders).

---

## Architecture Overview

```text
React Native / Expo Mobile App
 ├── App Navigation (Expo Router with Tab & Stack navigation)
 ├── UI Design System (Editorial Monolith Monochrome Theme)
 ├── State Layer (Zustand stores + TanStack Query)
 ├── Local Database (expo-sqlite with Migrations & Repositories)
 ├── Audio & Voice Services (expo-speech TTS + STT voice capture)
 └── API Client (Axios / Fetch with error handling)
       │
       ▼
 FastAPI Backend (Python)
 ├── REST API Endpoints (/conversation, /analyze, /topics, /feedback)
 ├── Gemini Service (Structured JSON output mode, Pydantic validation)
 └── Robust Fallbacks & Level-specific Prompt Engine (A1-C2)
```

