## Proposed Changes

### Backend (`backend/`)

#### [NEW] Backend Structure & Dependencies
- `backend/requirements.txt`: FastAPI, Uvicorn, google-genai / google-generativeai, pydantic, python-dotenv, httpx.
- `backend/.env.example`: Template with `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `HOST`, `PORT`, `CORS_ORIGINS`.
- `backend/app/config.py`: Settings model with Pydantic BaseSettings.
- `backend/app/main.py`: FastAPI entrypoint with CORS, route mounting, logging, and healthcheck.

#### [NEW] Backend Services & Schemas
- `backend/app/schemas/conversation.py`: Pydantic models for ConversationRequest, GeminiCorrection, GeminiResponse, SessionSummary, AnalyzeRequest.
- `backend/app/services/prompt_service.py`: Level-adaptive prompt generation (A1/A2 Beginner, B1/B2 Intermediate, C1/C2 Advanced), topic context, strict JSON schema instructions.
- `backend/app/services/gemini_service.py`: Robust integration with Gemini API (using structured JSON generation, fallback parsing, and error recovery).
- `backend/app/api/routes/conversation.py`: Routes for `/api/conversation/message`, `/api/conversation/analyze`, `/api/conversation/session`.
- `backend/app/api/routes/topics.py`: Categorized topics (Everyday, Professional, Advanced, Free).
- `backend/app/api/routes/health.py`: Healthcheck endpoint.

