### Mobile App (`mobile/`)

#### [NEW] Expo Project Setup & Config
- Initialize Expo app with TypeScript and Expo Router.
- Configure NativeWind / Tailwind styling matching `prototype/DESIGN.md` color tokens & typography.
- Setup `expo-sqlite`, `expo-speech`, `expo-secure-store`, `lucide-react-native` (or Vector Icons / Material Symbols matching prototype).

#### [NEW] Local SQLite Database Layer (`mobile/db/`)
- `mobile/db/database.ts`: SQLite database connection management.
- `mobile/db/migrations.ts`: Schema creation for `users`, `sessions`, `messages`, `corrections`, `vocabulary`, `progress`, `settings`.
- `mobile/db/repositories/`:
  - `userRepository.ts`: CRUD for user profile & level.
  - `sessionRepository.ts`: Session lifecycle & stats.
  - `messageRepository.ts`: Conversation message storage.
  - `correctionRepository.ts`: Feedback & mistakes tracking.
  - `vocabularyRepository.ts`: Discovered words & learned status.
  - `progressRepository.ts`: Speaking minutes, scores, daily streaks.

#### [NEW] State & Services (`mobile/store/`, `mobile/services/`)
- `mobile/store/useUserStore.ts`: User profile, CEFR level, daily goal, streak.
- `mobile/store/usePracticeStore.ts`: Active practice session, recording state (`IDLE`, `LISTENING`, `PROCESSING`, `AI_SPEAKING`, `ERROR`), audio levels.
- `mobile/store/useSettingsStore.ts`: Voice speed, dark/light theme, backend URL config.
- `mobile/services/api.ts`: API client connecting to FastAPI.
- `mobile/services/speech.ts` & `tts.ts`: Speech recognition & Text-to-Speech audio controller with playback speed controls.

#### [NEW] Application Screens (`mobile/app/`)
- `_layout.tsx`: Root layout with TanStack Query provider, database initialization hook, and font loading.
- `(tabs)/_layout.tsx`: Editorial Monolith bottom tab bar (Home, Practice, Progress, Profile).
- `(tabs)/index.tsx`: **Home Screen** (Greeting, CEFR level badge, daily goal progress bar, prominent Start Speaking CTA card, weekly activity metrics, recommended topics, recent mistakes).
- `(tabs)/practice.tsx`: **Practice Topics Screen** (Topic categories: Everyday, Professional, Advanced, Free conversation).
- `(tabs)/progress.tsx`: **Progress Screen** (Weekly speaking chart, daily minutes, streak tracker, fluency/grammar scores, category breakdown).
- `(tabs)/profile.tsx`: **Profile & Settings Screen** (User settings, voice controls, level picker, export local data, clear SQLite data with confirmation).
- `practice/session.tsx`: **Speaking Practice Screen** (Live conversation screen, avatar header, timer, audio rhythm bar, tactile mic button, expandable inline correction card, mute & quick-type drawer).
- `practice/summary.tsx`: **Session Summary Screen** (Speaking time, fluency/grammar scores, top improvements, new vocabulary words).
- `mistakes/index.tsx`: **Mistake History Screen** (Filtering by category: Grammar, Vocab, Pronunciation, Naturalness; severity badges; clear explanation).
- `vocabulary/index.tsx`: **Vocabulary Screen** (Word cards with definitions, contextual examples, pronunciation trigger, mark as learned).
- `onboarding/index.tsx`: **Onboarding Screen** (Step 1: Welcome, Step 2: Level Selection, Step 3: Goal Selection, Step 4: Daily Goal, Step 5: Microphone Permission).

